  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enlargement of a dwelling house (Class B) </span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- The erection of a&nbsp;</span></span>hip to gable roof extension, and L shaped rear roof\r\n     extension would consist of the enlargement of a dwelling house\r\nwithin the meaning of Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Town &amp; Country\r\nPlanning (General Permitted Development)&nbsp;\r\n(England) Order 2015 \"the Order\" and would comply with the\r\ndevelopment tolerances set out in said Class B. The operation would therefore\r\nhave been granted planning permission by Article 3 of the Order.</p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Alteration to the roof of the dwelling house (Class C)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The insertion of x2 rooflights to front roofslope would consist of any other alteration to the roof of the\r\ndwelling house within the meaning of Class C of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the\r\nTown &amp; Country Planning (General Permitted Development)&nbsp; (England) Order 2015 \"the Order\"\r\nand would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class C. The\r\noperation would therefore have been granted planning permission by Article 3 of\r\nthe Order.</span></span></p>"
